+  dm_is_private=True, platform_hint=<see photon/__init__.PLATFORM_HINT>, lock_env=("PHOTON_PROJECT_ID",))`.
+- `BUILTIN_CREDENTIALS`: **no row while disabled** (a row would turn the platform on from env alone);
